# ---------------- Claude Code / AI assistant local artifacts ----------------
# Per-developer tooling: project instructions, skills, subagents, memory and
# local settings. Not part of Scout itself, so it stays out of the repo.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/

# ---------------- recon tool litter ----------------
# Some tools write state into the working directory regardless of where their
# output is configured to go (subdominator drops resume.cfg). The stages now
# run with the per-domain output dir as CWD, but keep this so a stray one from
# a manual tool run never gets committed.
resume.cfg

# ---------------- local scan inputs & run artifacts ----------------
# Target lists fed to a local test run and the output/report it produced. These
# are per-engagement scratch, not part of Scout — anchored to the repo root so a
# stage that legitimately writes report.html into workspace/ is unaffected.
/domains.txt
/wildcards.txt
/out-scope.txt
/output.out
/report.html
